  "body": "Discover an exceptional opportunity to secure a brand-new home in one of the North Shore's most desirable established neighbourhoods. This exclusive boutique development of just five executive residences brings together contemporary design, quality living and an enviable Milford address.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed with space, comfort and functionality in mind, each home features three generously proportioned bedrooms, all complete with their own private ensuites. With three master suites and 3.5 bathrooms in total, this is a home that offers outstanding flexibility and privacy for families, professionals or those who enjoy having extra space for guests.\r\n\r\nThe interiors showcase a stylish contemporary aesthetic, with quality finishes and well-considered layouts designed to complement modern living. A single internal-access garage adds further convenience and practicality.\r\n\r\nA Premium Milford Location\r\n\r\nMilford is renowned for its established residential character, leafy streets and welcoming community. Long regarded as one of the North Shore's most desirable neighbourhoods, it offers an appealing combination of lifestyle, convenience and lasting location appeal.\r\n\r\nEnjoy being just moments from Milford Shopping Centre, with its excellent selection of supermarkets, boutique retailers, cafes and restaurants. Convenient motorway access also provides easy connections to Auckland CBD and destinations across the North Shore.\r\n\r\nExcellent Schooling - A Major Family Advantage\r\n\r\nFamilies will particularly appreciate the sought-after school zones, including Milford Primary School, Takapuna Intermediate, Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School. Access to these highly regarded schools makes this an especially attractive proposition for families looking to secure a quality home in a premium educational location.\r\n\r\nA Rare Boutique Opportunity\r\n\r\nWith only five brand-new residences available, this is a limited opportunity to enjoy modern executive living in an established Milford neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nWhether you are upgrading your family home, seeking a sophisticated lifestyle or looking for a quality property in a blue-chip location, these homes deserve your attention.\r\n\r\nBrand new, beautifully designed and superbly positioned - welcome to a better standard of Milford living.\r\n\r\nFor further information, please see this link: https://harcourts.net/L43900221",
